Source data: CDC/NCHS, National Health and Nutrition Examination Survey,
2015-2016 public-use PAH_I, DEMO_I, DPQ_I, BMX_I and ALB_CR_I data files.
Original files are available without charge from:
https://wwwn.cdc.gov/nchs/nhanes/continuousnhanes/default.aspx?BeginYear=2015

nhanes_pah is a clearly identified derived teaching dataset: a selected cohort,
six selected exposures and fixed artificial left censoring. It is not the
original NHANES data release. Censored true concentrations are not included.
The prepared R object is natural-logged; the CSV contains raw-scale observed
values and NA for artificially censored entries.

The source data are US federal government public-use data. The package code is
